      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْبَلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Broken,</i> or <i>crumbled, bread,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيدٌ</span>, M,
K,) or <i>a mess of broken,</i> or <i>crumbled, bread,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيدَةٌ</span>, AA, TA,) <i>having,</i> (K,) or <i>moistened
with,</i> (AA,) <i>grease,</i> or <i>dripping,</i> or <i>gravy,</i> (AA,
K,) or <i>having much thereof.</i> (M.)

